],"Add RSS feed":[""],"\u201c%s\u201d is saved":[""],"Every slider can pick it now, from the Feed Settings panel in the editor.":[""],"Dismiss this message":[""],"No JSON feeds saved yet":[""],"No RSS feeds saved yet":[""],"No Instagram accounts saved yet":[""],"No channels saved yet":[""],"A saved JSON feed is an address kept once for the whole site. Any slider can pick it, and correcting it here corrects every slider at once.":[""],"A saved RSS feed is an address kept once for the whole site. Any slider can pick it, and correcting it here corrects every slider at once.":[""],"A saved Instagram connection is kept once for the whole site. Any slider can pick it, and correcting it here corrects every slider at once.":[""],"A saved channel is an address kept once for the whole site. Any slider can pick it, and correcting it here corrects every slider at once.":[""],"Add your first JSON feed":[""],"Add your first RSS feed":[""],"Add your first Instagram Account":[""],"Add your first channel":[""],"Feed Name":[""],"Account \/ Username":[""],"Feed \/ Channel":[""],"Imported":[""],"Used by":[""],"Actions":[""],"none":[""],"no slider yet":[""],"Remove Instagram account \u201c%s\u201d? Any sliders using it will go back to loading live directly.":[""],"Remove feed \u201c%s\u201d? Any sliders using it will go back to reading the feed live directly.":[""],"Remove \u201c%1$s\u201d? %2$d slider(s) still use it, and they fall back to whatever address they last carried.":[""],"Remove \u201c%s\u201d? Anything it imported stays on the site and shows up under Storage as unused.":[""],"Remove":[""],"The key could not be saved.":[""],"The credentials could not be saved.":[""],"Keys are stored on this site and never written into a page, so they are not visible to visitors.":[""],"YouTube Data API":[""],"Optional. Without a key a channel\u2019s public feed gives 15 videos and is rate-limited by YouTube; with one you get up to 200, plus each video\u2019s length and view count.":[""],"Chec